085 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1074 \uc0\u1099 \uc0\u1082 \uc0\u1080 :{\line}{\line}{\line}Backend: PHP (OOP, PDO, MVC pattern), REST API integration, Node.js (scripts / WhatsApp API integrations).{\line}{\line}Databases: MySQL (DB Architecture, Foreign Keys, Indexing, Prepared Statements).{\line}{\line}Frontend: JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5/CSS3, PWA (Service Workers, Web App Manifest), AJAX / Fetch API.{\line}{\line}Security: OWASP basics (XSS/CSRF protection, SQL Injection prevention, Data Sanitization, Password Hashing).{\line}{\line}DevOps & Tools: Git, Plesk / cPanel, Webmail, Google Analytics / Yandex Metrika, SEO optimization.{\line}{\line}{\line}{\line}\uc0\u1054 \uc0\u1073 \uc0\u1083 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1076 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1102  \uc0\u1087 \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1082 \uc0\u1090 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1095 \uc0\u1077 \uc0\u1089 \uc0\u1082 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1084  \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1087 \uc0\u1099 \uc0\u1090 \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1084  \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1079 \uc0\u1074 \uc0\u1077 \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1090 \uc0\u1099 \uc0\u1074 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1085 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1103  \uc0\u1083 \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1082 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1083 \uc0\u1100 \uc0\u1085 \uc0\u1099 \uc0\u1093  \uc0\u1089 \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1077 \uc0\u1076  \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1079 \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1073 \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1090 \uc0\u1082 \uc0\u1080  (Node.js/Vite) \uc0\u1080  \uc0\u1089 \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1079 \uc0\u1076 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1085 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1103  \uc0\u1089 \uc0\u1082 \uc0\u1074 \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1079 \uc0\u1085 \uc0\u1099 \uc0\u1093  \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1077 \uc0\u1096 \uc0\u1077 \uc0\u1085 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1081 : \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1090  \uc0\u1087 \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1077 \uc0\u1082 \uc0\u1090 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1074 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1085 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1103  \uc0\u1090 \uc0\u1072 \uc0\u1073 \uc0\u1083 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1094  \uc0\u1074  \uc0\u1088 \uc0\u1077 \uc0\u1083 \uc0\u1103 \uc0\u1094 \uc0\u1080 \uc0\u1086 \uc0\u1085 \uc0\u1085 \uc0\u1099 \uc0\u1093  \uc